<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period Feb 3-16 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>Normally Abecitrus releases figures on a weekly basis but it combined the two-week period to Feb 16 because of last week's Carnival holiday.</p>
<p>		    Feb 3-16    Feb 5-18	 TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		     1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    499,214.6	 n/a</p>
<p> Production	 7,321.2	 n/a     1,086,808.3	 n/a</p>
<p> Shipment	  37,364.4	 n/a	 777,019.7	 n/a</p>
<p> Home Market	  637.2	 n/a	  10,702.2	 n/a</p>
<p> Stocks/close   468,534.2	 n/a</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
